# Project map (Godot 4.x)

- **Combat orchestrator:** `combat/CombatManager.gd` — Node with `combatants`, `event_queue`, signals. Keeps registration, `start()` (seeds **`formation_doctrine`** via **`CombatConstants.encounter_formation_doctrine_string`** on **`encounter`**, then **`CombatConstants.formation_doctrine_string_from_dict`** on each preset dict — **`FORMATION_PRESET_KEY_DOCTRINE`** + **`FORMATION_PRESET_KEY_DOCTRINE_ALT`**, per side; seeds **`depth_polearm_ai_doctrine_mults_by_fid`** via **`CombatConstants.depth_polearm_ai_doctrine_mults_for_encounter_and_preset`**; reads use **`get_depth_polearm_ai_doctrine_mult`**; seeds **`rout_thresholds_by_fid`** via **`CombatConstants.rout_thresholds_for_encounter_and_preset`** for **`CombatFormationRout`**), and thin `func` forwards. Loaded via `core/ResourcePaths.gd` → `COMBAT_MANAGER`. Public **`get_health_entity(node)`** for Character→CoreEntity resolution; subsystems use **`CombatantEntityAccess.get_entity_from_manager`** / **`get_health_entity_from_node`**. **`CombatFileKeyedDict`** for int/string file keys in formation breach/wedge dicts.
- **Combat subsystems (preload from manager or call static):** **`CombatantEntityAccess`** (**`combatant_cooldown_active`**, **`cooldown_remaining_s`**, entity/combatant reads), **`CombatListedActions`** (scan **`build()`** / action arrays: move id, target, signatures), **`CombatMobilityRetreat`** (Tier **6.1** retreat-only filter; forwards listing scans), `CombatProcessTick`, `CombatEventScheduler` (**`reschedule_back_rank_turns`** + rank/file snapshots vs **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**; unconscious-only scheduling gates), `CombatEventDispatch` (**`handle_action_ready`** mobile cowering gauge), `CombatStateHandlers` (**`process_incapacitation`** skips unconscious, not mobile cowering), `CombatResolveAction`, `CombatEngagementResolver`, `CombatFormationFlow` (intrusion slots + **`intrusion_wedge_by_file`** + vacancy/death plugs + **`on_combatant_died`** host **`slot_obstacles`** / `notify` vs **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`** + **`reconcile_vacancy_plugs_*`** from `CombatManager.notify_formation_changed` / `get_available_actions`), `CombatIntrusionWedge` (wedge upsert/clear; lane-stress helper), `CombatFormationSetup`, `CombatFormationEngagement` (line cohesion + posture; wedge/breach; LINE↔OPEN hysteresis; calls **`CombatMoraleCohesion`** for `morale_cohesion_factor`), `CombatIntrusionGeometry` (crash neighbor hold on **host** line via **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), `CombatDistanceBands` (**`depth_polearm_lane_open_by_combatant_id`**; harness → **`docs/REGRESSION_HARNESS_MAP_TIER19.md`** · plan [§1.9](docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md#tier-19--p10-depth-rank-polearm-reach--spear-lanes)), `ZoneOfControl` (**`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**, **`formation_dict_for_zone_geometry`** — intruder host fid + shared **`formations[fid]`** read for **`assign_combatant_zones`**, **`count_alive_in_zone`** (ZoC fill), ZoC **engagement parry**, **pair distance**, **AI targeting / crash** formation lookups), `TacticalCombat` (lane stress: max(breach_local, wedge)), `BreachResolver`, `FormationBreachRules`, `CombatCombatantsSnapshot` (UI rows), **`CombatMedicalCoordination`** (retry, **`get_parts_being_treated_on`**, **`medical_action_allowed`**, **`filter_actions_for_pick`**, stack-assist eligibility — [§6.3](docs/MEDICAL_PAIN_INCAPACITATION.md#tier-63-medical-phase-coordination-live-path)), `AttackResolver`, `AvailableActionsBuilder` (orchestrates **`build()`**; forwards geometry/strike/melee-rank/crash APIs; **`CombatMeleeListing`**, **`CombatFormationMoveListing`**, **`CombatMedicalActionListing`**; **`CombatAttention.append_focus_line_listing_actions`**; verbose list log **`CombatDebug.log_available_actions_build`**), **`CombatTargetScoring`** (hostile listed weights: doctrine pinch/hold, engagement mode, posture+cohesion, opponent formation, breached-file column (**`opponent_breach_file_targeting_mult`**), stance; intruder-aware via **`formation_id_for_zone_geometry`**), **`CombatDoctrine`** (per-formation doctrine string; automatic pinch pilot), **`CombatAIActionPicker`** (weighted `pick`; medical-phase action refresh + coordination filter; **`MEDICAL_AI_WEIGHT_TREATMENT_ASSIST_PRESSURE`**; **`AI_FORMATION_MOVE_BLOCKED_LANE_MULT`** on **`rotate_file`**; **`COWERING_SOLO_FALL_BACK_AI_WEIGHT`**; crash viability × posture × line cohesion; depth spear stab/cut × doctrine; prunes commitments once per pick), **`CombatFootwork`** (Tier **4.4** position-angle step; **`clear_on_exchange_end`**; UI **`offset_visible_for_ui_state`**), `MedicalPhaseController`, etc. under `combat/`. **Tier 6.1** entity/combat gates: **`CombatantEntityAccess.is_unconscious`**, **`can_flee_or_fall_back`**, **`is_cowering`**; pain shock hit + ambient (**`FEATURE_AMBIENT_PAIN_SHOCK`**, **`EntityPainConsciousness.try_ambient_pain_shock_tick`** in **`CombatProcessTick`**); harness **`_run_medical_*`**, **`_run_medical_coordination_*`** · [`MEDICAL` §6.1](docs/MEDICAL_PAIN_INCAPACITATION.md#tier-61-mobility-pain-shock-live-path) · [§6.3](docs/MEDICAL_PAIN_INCAPACITATION.md#tier-63-medical-phase-coordination-live-path). **`FEATURE_LINE_CRASH_INTRUSION`** + sector surround + **`FEATURE_FLURRY_BIND_EXCHANGE`** in `CombatConstants.gd` (defaults **true**); see `IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` [gates](docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md#development-gate-line-crash--intrusions-temporary) + [next step](docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md#next-coding-step). **Plan / status:** [all tiers at a glance](docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md#all-tiers-at-a-glance) — **do not** duplicate **Status** in rules. **Forward integration:** [POST_MILESTONE_INTEGRATION_PLAN.md](docs/POST_MILESTONE_INTEGRATION_PLAN.md) (Phases 0–5). **Tier 1 spec** §4–§6: `docs/ENGAGEMENT_LINE_COHESION_INTRUSION_PLAN.md`.
- **Weapons (abstract impact):** `weapon/WeaponConstants.gd`, `weapon/WeaponDamageHelper.gd`, `weapon/ImpactVelocityModel.gd`, `weapon/WeaponSwingPhysics.gd` — **Tier 3.0** thrust vs swing **`kinematic_delivery`** (plan: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md` Tier 3 + dependency chain item 12).
- **Tuning:** `combat/CombatConstants.gd` (large by design; debug consts default **false**; flip **`COMBAT_DEV_VERBOSE`** for all flow + hit traces in F5 play). **Milestone Status** → [all tiers at a glance](docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ORDER.md#all-tiers-at-a-glance) only. **Harness** → grep `combat/CombatRegressionHarness.gd` · exhaustive `_run_*` in **`docs/REGRESSION_HARNESS_MAP_TIER19.md`**. **Live paths** → **`docs/README.md`** “Shipped-tier live paths” row.
- **Entities:** `core/CoreEntity.gd` plus `EntityMedical`, `EntityDamage`, `EntityWounds`, …
- **Battle UI:** `ui/BattleScene.gd`, `BattleUIUpdater.gd` (**`gauge_label_text_for_combatant`**), `FormationDiagramBuilder.gd`, `TurnReadyHandler` → **`CombatPlayerTurnHints`** (**`sync_formation_listed_turn_hint_on_combatant`** → combat log + **`COMBATANT_KEY_FORMATION_MOVES_TURN_HINT`** on gauge); hint resolution **`CombatUiHints`** (footwork / attention / counter-tempo / bind flurry when **`CombatFlurryBind.enabled()`**; **`CombatFootwork.clear_on_exchange_end`** on abort; step UI only in **`wind_up`**/**`recovering`** via **`offset_visible_for_ui_state`**; **`CombatFormationMoveDuration`** preview + listed hints; harness **`_run_footwork_*`**, **`_run_battle_ui_gauge_label_*`**, **`_run_combat_ui_hints_*`**, **`_run_flurry_*`**, **`_run_formation_move_duration_*`**). **`CombatFormationFlee`** + **`CombatFormationRout`** (Tier **6.2** rout: `line_cohesion` + casualty ratio; **`side_holding_field`** dampener; encounter **`flee_*_max/min_*`**; **`ensure_rout_baseline`**; **`FP_COMBAT`** on flee in play session), **`CombatWeaponPosition`**, **`CombatIncomingParryChoice`** (Tier **0** multi-incoming parry).

When adding behavior, extend the **smallest** existing module that owns that concern; avoid growing `CombatManager.gd` beyond orchestration and public API.
